Notebook[{

Cell[CellGroupData[{
Cell["GWPPhaseSpace", "Title",
 CellID->979287279,ExpressionUUID->"af3a2553-2f92-4bda-9cf4-c49b5d601f91"],

Cell["\<\
The Phase Space extension provides a comprehensive suite of tools for \
analyzing continuous-variable quantum systems in phase space. It extends the \
core GWPTools framework to evaluate spatial and momentum density matrices, \
alongside quasi-probability distributions including the Wigner function and \
Husimi Q-distribution. Additionally, it calculates essential quantum \
information metrics such as state purity, Wehrl entropy, and von Neumann \
entropy. Operating as a dynamic master orchestrator, the package \
automatically detects active core mathematical engines and loads their \
corresponding exact analytical implementations to guarantee optimal backend \
performance.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.9988468840803137`*^9, 3.998846886611725*^9}},
 CellID->1366658017,ExpressionUUID->"a62b7ec2-2af3-4e56-9423-51878d7a8052"],

Cell["\<\
Future development will focus on adding functionality to support different \
GWP types, such as superposition states, multi-dimensional wavepackets, and \
dissipative systems.\
\>", "Text",
 CellID->2083687054,ExpressionUUID->"78137920-c935-43eb-96a3-90d45a1caf6c"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["Initialization", "Section",
 CellID->1699281473,ExpressionUUID->"27640a85-d271-41df-8369-0d1e757cad16"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["\<\
To evaluate the examples in this technical note, load the required contexts:\
\>", "Text",
 CellID->438695258,ExpressionUUID->"213dbc55-655d-4bcb-82af-b76eed6b429f"],

Cell[BoxData[{
 RowBox[{"Needs", "[", "\"\<GWPTools`\>\"", "]"}], "\n", 
 RowBox[{"Needs", "[", "\"\<GWPTools`GWPPhaseSpace`\>\"", "]"}], "\n", 
 RowBox[{"Needs", "[", "\"\<GWPTools`GWPDeveloper`\>\"", "]"}]}], "Input",
 CellLabel->"In[1]:=",
 CellID->839841055,ExpressionUUID->"80ef1376-4494-466f-90d2-219cd16f80f8"]
}, Open  ]]
}, Open  ]],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["Frontend Registration & Introspection", "Section",
 CellID->1946083301,ExpressionUUID->"4e00e705-69df-45df-a50d-a7935def7c0c"],

Cell["\<\
As an extension package, GWPPhaseSpace dynamically supports multiple GWP \
Types based on which core engines are currently active in the kernel. At \
present, it supports the \"1D\" and \"SS1D\" mathematical engines. Querying \
the introspection parameter bus reveals the available physics properties and \
macro keys provided by the \"PhaseSpace\" class for a given type:\
\>", "Text",
 CellID->1646096097,ExpressionUUID->"31ded197-c3b7-4607-95cd-3459636565c3"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["1D Phase Space Class", "Subsection",
 CellID->2052761625,ExpressionUUID->"ce057643-1c55-4ae2-b898-6c3ee802bba2"],

