Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["Backend Mathematical Engines (Developer)", "Section",
 CellID->631468702,ExpressionUUID->"7fdce6d2-41bb-40fc-98ce-5d5088e99b9f"],

Cell["\<\
The underlying backend functions utilize raw mathematical symbols to ensure \
maximum evaluation speed. The Phase Space engines enforce strict pattern \
matching: if parameterized properties (like Husimi or Wehrl) are not provided \
with a continuous shape scalar, they automatically fall back to the default \
coherent state width of s = 1/2. Below are the canonical evaluations and \
argument patterns for the 1-Dimensional spatial engine.\
\>", "Text",
 CellID->230291040,ExpressionUUID->"dd3dbcc2-a7e6-401b-945b-b306db1618cc"],

