Cell["Phase Space Metrics", "Subsection",
 CellID->1026130575,ExpressionUUID->"b75e061d-046a-43e5-96ec-e36630e4baa1"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["\<\
Because the standard 1D engine models pure Gaussian states, the purity and \
von Neumann entropy evaluate trivially to 1 and 0, respectively. The Wehrl \
entropy depends explicitly on the reference coherent state width:\
\>", "Text",
 CellID->1882888615,ExpressionUUID->"51b8119f-02c7-4c0b-8cbc-1241f64544ad"],

